Output demo.gif

Require node

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1080
Set Height 660
Set Padding 16
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Sleep 600ms
Type "STEP_DELAY_MS=650 npm start"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 11s
Sleep 1500ms
